{
  "about": "Shared cases of the one product line price (unit = size price + cutting extra + packaging extra, VAT included; line = unit x quantity; \"without\" items free). The API (services/api/src/modules/catalog/application/pricing.service.spec.ts, through priceLine) and the apps' price function run every case and must give exactly `expected`. Products use the public product's field names; amounts are integer halalas. `errors` are compared in order: PRODUCT_UNAVAILABLE, then OPTION_NOT_IN_PRODUCT (size), SIZE_UNAVAILABLE, OPTION_NOT_IN_PRODUCT (cutting, packaging, without items; each code once), INCOMPATIBLE_CUTTING_PACKAGING, and OPTION_REQUIRED only when nothing else is wrong. Any error but OPTION_REQUIRED zeroes the line and empties the breakdown. Add a case here, never in one client only.",
